    "detailed_description": "<h1>Release update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is currently in the approval queue by the Steam/Valve teem, and we are hoping to release soon!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help him impregnate a town full of women </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Builder, you play the role of a skilled young man who is commissioned to build a memorial in a village in the far north. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon you discover that your real task is quite different: In order to save the village from extinction, you must make all the women there pregnant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is a choice based visual novel game. It has a clear and engaging storyline and a rich cast of characters. Get ready for an experience out of the ordinary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We follow the main character through a full year of work - all the way to the completion of the memorial - and the successful breeding of the women of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is a sophisticated adult visual novel, now in its second season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 2 picks up directly after Season 1, and you continue your quest to save the village, one impregnation at the time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 6 seasons (30 episodes) are planned. The story is currently near the closing of Season 2, and by purchasing the early release, you have a season pass, including the last episode of Season 2 as soon as it is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support the development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support the development of The Builder, you can wishlist all the seasons here on Steam.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help him impregnate a town full of women </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Builder, you play the role of a skilled young man who is commissioned to build a memorial in a village in the far north. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon you discover that your real task is quite different: In order to save the village from extinction, you must make all the women there pregnant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is a choice based visual novel game. It has a clear and engaging storyline and a rich cast of characters. Get ready for an experience out of the ordinary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We follow the main character through a full year of work - all the way to the completion of the memorial - and the successful breeding of the women of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Builder is a sophisticated adult visual novel, now in its second season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 2 picks up directly after Season 1, and you continue your quest to save the village, one impregnation at the time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 6 seasons (30 episodes) are planned. The story is currently near the closing of Season 2, and by purchasing the early release, you have a season pass, including the last episode of Season 2 as soon as it is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support the development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support the development of The Builder, you can wishlist all the seasons here on Steam.</p>",
